{"kind": "tool", "step": 1, "name": "read_document", "arguments": {"document_id": "case-10-official-storage"}, "result": {"id": "case-10-official-storage", "title": "JuniperGrid 5.5: official snapshot retention reference", "text": "# JuniperGrid 5.5 storage reference\n\nFor the default deployment profile in release 5.5, snapshot retention is 70 calendar days (retention_days=70).\nThe timer and importer defaults are maintained in the separate community compatibility reference for this exact release.\nRetention is measured in days, not hours. Explicit tenant overrides are outside this default-profile reference.\n"}}
{"kind": "tool", "step": 1, "name": "read_document", "arguments": {"document_id": "case-10-community-source"}, "result": {"id": "case-10-community-source", "title": "JuniperGrid 5.5: checkpoint and parallel import defaults", "text": "# JuniperGrid 5.5 community compatibility reference\n\nScope: the default deployment profile of JuniperGrid release 5.5.\nThe default checkpoint interval is 16 minutes (checkpoint_minutes=16).\nThe default maximum number of parallel import jobs is 11 (max_parallel_imports=11).\nThe official snapshot-retention reference contains the retention default.\nThese values concern defaults; tenant overrides and older releases are excluded.\n\n"}}
